      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet parents report that their dogs love attending daycare and boarding at the Brickell facility, coming home tired and happy from socialization and play. While one critical reviewer alleged mistreatment and another noted rough play scratches, the vast majority describe their pets feeling secure and excited upon arrival."
