      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently commend staff members such as Carolina, Jose, Maria, and Genesis for their welcoming attitude and genuine affection toward dogs. Clients appreciate that attendants notice individual pet personalities and provide reassurance, though an isolated complaint cited poor customer service during a dispute."
      }
