        "en": "Dog owners who utilize grooming and daycare services express high satisfaction with bath quality, haircuts, and coat care. Clients observe that anxious pets feel relaxed during grooming appointments and that boarding stays provide dependable exercise, leaving dogs calm and well rested after their stay."
      }
